  "title": "Awesome Irish Nachos",
  "description": "These Irish nachos feature waffle fries garnished with fresh tomatoes, olives, jalapeños, and lettuce for a first-rate St. Patrick&#39;s Day appetizer.",
  "authors": [
    "GailC"
  ],
